    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebrate cosplay and geek culture together with Annie Tangerine!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Crash Huskey Con, roundhouse kick cosplayers, and save your friends from becoming mindless nerds in this fast-paced action platformer with beat'em-up elements!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You're Annie Tangerine - definitely NOT a gamer - and you've just stumbled into the world's most anticipated convention. Some of the cosplayers are acting weird, and there's a guy with a TV for a head running the show. Time to solve this the only way you know how: with your fists and your kicks (Yea, your passion is Muay Thai)!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">FEATURES:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">DEMOLISH  mind-controlled cosplayers with your martial arts moves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">EXPLORE the biggest convention center filled with shops, party zones, and suspicious VR booths</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">CUSTOMIZE Annie with different outfits - from knightly armor to boxing gear</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">RESCUE your friends who just want to have great time cosplaying, but keep getting in trouble</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">UNRAVEL the mystery behind Milon Huskey's evil plan before the main cosplay event takes place and there is no way back</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who knew making friends at a convention would involve so much punching? Probably everyone, honestly.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Note: No actual nerds were harmed in the making of this game. They were just temporarily inconvenienced.</p>",
